  "description": "The meme relies on the rhetorical device of ironic juxtaposition — placing two contrasting ideas (a celebratory firework vs. a violent terrorist) side by side to create humor or provoke thought. This requires understanding of rhetorical strategies and the cultural weight of the terms involved.",
